# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: /vendor and /public/build are deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# The production host has no SSH, no Composer and no Node, so the only way to
# deploy is to commit the installed dependencies and the built assets and let
# cPanel's Git Version Control pull them. Run `npm run build` before you commit.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
